===Verb===
{{en-verb}}

# {{lb|en|ambitransitive}} To use two-way radio to transmit (a message) (to another radio or other radio operator).
#: ''I think the boat is sinking; we'd better '''radio''' for help.'' / ''I '''radioed''' him already.'' / '''''Radio''' the coordinates this time.'' / ''OK. I '''radioed''' them the coordinates.''
# {{lb|en|transitive}} To order or assist (to a location), using telecommunications.
